<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are dwelling in the love of the Lord,</l><l>He our unity has now restored.</l><l>Brothers, sisters in one family,</l><l>As the Father and the Son, always one,</l><l>So are we!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>How good and pleasant it can be</l><l>When brothers dwell in unity;</l><l>Like sweet anointing and the mountain dew;</l><l>Life eternal for me and for you—</l><l>All things are new!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
